WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.601
-Today is a day
all about giving thanks,

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:04.067
so why not a better day
to write out my weekly

00:00:04.067 --> 00:00:05.667
Thank You Notes right now?
You guys mind?

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:06.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.868 --> 00:00:09.200
Oh, I'd love to.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.767
James, can I get some

00:00:10.767 --> 00:00:12.734
Thank You Note writing music,
please?

00:00:12.734 --> 00:00:14.634
♪♪

00:00:14.634 --> 00:00:16.133
-Wow.

00:00:16.133 --> 00:00:19.033
♪♪

00:00:19.033 --> 00:00:20.467
Thankful.

00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:22.033
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.033 --> 00:00:23.601
♪♪

00:00:23.601 --> 00:00:25.734
-Thank you,
Thanksgiving leftovers,

00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:28.634
for leading to an epic game
of Fridge Tetris.

00:00:28.634 --> 00:00:30.934
[ Laughs ]

00:00:30.934 --> 00:00:32.567
[ Applause ]

00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:36.400
♪♪

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:39.067
Thank you,
canned cranberry sauce,

00:00:39.067 --> 00:00:40.901
for being the only thing
that keeps its shape

00:00:40.901 --> 00:00:42.534
after Thanksgiving.

00:00:42.534 --> 00:00:44.934
Yeah. Can't mess with that.

00:00:44.934 --> 00:00:48.067
I like --

00:00:48.067 --> 00:00:50.334
I like a good dessert
to have -- that has abs.

00:00:50.334 --> 00:00:51.767
-Yeah. [ Laughs ]

00:00:54.367 --> 00:00:55.667
♪♪

00:00:55.667 --> 00:00:58.067
-Thank you, World Cup trophy.
-Ooh.

00:00:58.067 --> 00:01:00.334
-Because everyone knows
the first rule of soccer

00:01:00.334 --> 00:01:02.234
is hold the ball with two hands.

00:01:02.234 --> 00:01:04.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.601 --> 00:01:07.100
Wait. What?
-What?

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.167
[ Applause ]

00:01:09.167 --> 00:01:10.601
♪♪

00:01:10.601 --> 00:01:13.400
-Thank you, peeling potatoes,
for either being a sign

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:16.767
that you're helping Mom or did
something wrong in boot camp.

00:01:16.767 --> 00:01:19.033
[ Applause ]

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:23.534
Beetle Bailey!
Get over here!

00:01:24.834 --> 00:01:26.200
♪♪

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:28.834
-Thank you, Thanksgiving,
for being that special day

00:01:28.834 --> 00:01:31.100
when your family is either upset
you're not married

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:33.501
or upset about
who you did marry.

00:01:33.501 --> 00:01:35.334
[ Laughs ]

00:01:35.334 --> 00:01:39.000
[ Applause ]

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:40.968
"He's a loozah!"

00:01:43.167 --> 00:01:44.400
♪♪

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:46.434
Thank you,
airport X-ray machine,

00:01:46.434 --> 00:01:48.601
for letting me work off
Thanksgiving

00:01:48.601 --> 00:01:50.834
by doing one very slow
jumping jack.

00:01:50.834 --> 00:01:53.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.367 --> 00:01:55.400
[ Applause ]

00:02:02.367 --> 00:02:03.901
♪♪

00:02:03.901 --> 00:02:06.701
Thank you, family photos,
for letting me remember

00:02:06.701 --> 00:02:10.501
exactly what mood each family
member was in at the time.

00:02:10.501 --> 00:02:12.767
There you have it, everybody.
Those are our Thank You Notes.

00:02:12.767 --> 00:02:14.300
We'll be right back.

